            "review_title": "Review at Ayam Penyet Vindo - Halal",
            "review_text": "Andrew S\nPhnom Penh, Cambodia8 contributions\n0\nVery Good Chicken Nasi Goreng\nJun 2025 • Solo\nThe company I work for recently moved to the same neighbour hood. I found this place when searching for some nasi goreng (fried rice) for lunch. This was one of the best nasi goreng I ever tried in Vietnam. I chose the chicken nasi goreng and it has many ingredients, very tasty and cooked very well. The price was also very reasonable and the staff friendly. I highly recommend this place and I will visit again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 16, 2025",
